      "notes": "* Connection: choose Companion or Local VPN, each with its own anisette server. iPhone and iPad can use LocalDevVPN without a computer.\n* LiveContainer: export your signing certificate as a .p12 (Settings > Share Signing) for LiveContainer's JIT-less mode. Tested with Delta on iOS 27; see Supported apps.\n* Stop: a new Stop button ends a refresh or install at any step.\n* Clearer failures: an unreachable anisette server or device says so and offers to retry or switch modes, and a refresh no longer retries a sign-in that already failed.\n* Security: rustls is updated for four advisories, and the trusted root CAs drop eMudhra's emSign roots. TLS is what protects the anisette library Apparition downloads.\n* Privacy: the Apple ID, team, certificate names, URLs and addresses are kept out of the logs.\n* Fixes: a just-installed app is no longer reported missing, Remove from Library works for apps deleted from the Home Screen, and the Share Signing share sheet stays open.",
